msgstr "KWuFTPd"

#: Logging.cpp:17
msgid "Log commands:"
msgstr "Bilježi komande:"

#: Logging.cpp:18
msgid ""
"Use these check boxes to control for which types of users all commands will "
"be logged."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete označiti za koje će korisnike sve komande biti "
"zabilježene u posebnu datoteku."

#: Logging.cpp:23
msgid "Log transfers:"
msgstr "Bilježi prenose:"

#: Logging.cpp:24
msgid ""
"Use these check boxes to control for which types of users file transfers "
"will be logged."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete označiti za koje će korisnike svi prenosi datoteka biti "
"zabilježeni u posebnu datoteku."

#: Logging.cpp:28
msgid "Inbound:"
msgstr "Ulazni:"

#: Logging.cpp:29
msgid "Log inbound transfers (uploads to this server)"
msgstr "Bilježi ulazne prenose (upload-a na ovaj server)"

#: Logging.cpp:31
msgid "Outbound:"
msgstr "Izlazni:"

#: Logging.cpp:32
msgid "Log outbound transfers (downloads from this server)"
msgstr "Bilježi izlazne prenose (download-e s ovog servera)"

#: Logging.cpp:33
msgid "Security log:"
msgstr "Sigurnosne zabilješke:"

#: Logging.cpp:34
msgid "Log security-related messages (failed logins etc.)"
msgstr "Bilježi poruke u vezi sigurnosti (neuspjele prijave itd)"

#: Logging.cpp:48
msgid "A&nonymous"
msgstr "A&noniman"

#: Logging.cpp:49
msgid ""
"Log commands given by anonymous (username <i>ftp</i> or <i>anonymous</i>) "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Bilježi komande date od anonimnih (ime korisnika <i>ftp</i> ili <i>anonymous</i>) "
"korisnika."

#: Logging.cpp:52 NewClass.cpp:26 UserClasses.cpp:31
msgid "&Guest"
msgstr "&Gost"

#: Logging.cpp:53
msgid ""
"Log commands given by guest users (users with a real account, but restricted "
"access)."
msgstr ""
"Bilježi komande date od korisnika \"gostiju\" (korisnici sa stvarnim kontom, ali "
"ograničenim pristupom)"

#: Logging.cpp:56 NewClass.cpp:29 UserClasses.cpp:33
msgid "&Real"
msgstr "Stva&rni"

#: Logging.cpp:57
msgid ""
"Log commands given by real users (users with an unrestricted account on the "
"server"
msgstr ""
"Bilježi komande date od \"stvarnih\" korisnika (korisnici sa kontom bez ograničenja "
"na ovom serveru)"

#: Logging.cpp:60
msgid "An&onymous"
msgstr "An&oniman"

#: Logging.cpp:61
msgid ""
"Log inbound transfers (uploads to the server) by anonymous users (username "
"<i>ftp</i> or <i>anonymous</i>)"
msgstr ""
"Bilježi \"ulazne\" transfere (upload-e na server) od strane anonimnih korisnika "
"(ime korisnika <i>ftp</i> ili <i>anonymous</i>)"

#: Logging.cpp:63
msgid "G&uest"
msgstr "G&ost"

#: Logging.cpp:64
msgid ""
"Log inbound transfers (uploads to the server) by guest users (users with a "
"real account, but restricted access)"
msgstr ""
"Bilježi \"ulazne\" transfere (upload-e na server) od strane \"gostiju\" "
"(korisnici sa stvarnim kontom, ali sa ograničenim pristupom)"

#: Logging.cpp:66
msgid "R&eal"
msgstr "S&tvarni"

#: Logging.cpp:67
msgid ""
"Log inbound transfers (uploads to the server) by real users (users with a "
"real account and without restrictions)"
msgstr ""
"Bilježi \"ulazne\" transfere (upload-e na server) od strane pravih korisnika "
"(korisnici sa stvarnim kontom i bez ograničenja u pristupu)"

#: Logging.cpp:70
msgid "Anon&ymous"
msgstr "Anon&iman"

#: Logging.cpp:71
msgid ""
"Log outbound transfers (downloads from the server) by anonymous users "
"(username <i>ftp</i> or <i>anonymous</i>)"
msgstr ""
"Bilježi \"izlazne\" transfere (download-e sa servera) od strane anonimnih "
"korisnika (ime korisnika <i>ftp</i> ili <i>anonymous</i>)"

#: Logging.cpp:73
msgid "Gue&st"
msgstr "Go&st"

#: Logging.cpp:74
msgid ""
"Log outbound transfers (downloads from the server) by guest users (users "
"with a real account, but restricted access)"
msgstr ""
"Bilježi \"izlazne\" transfere (download-e sa servera) od strane \"gostiju\" "
"(korisnici sa stvarnim kontom, ali sa ograničenim pristupom)"

#: Logging.cpp:76
msgid "Re&al"
msgstr "Stva&rni"

#: Logging.cpp:77
msgid ""
"Log outbound transfers (downloads from the server) by real users (users with "
"a real account and without restrictions)"
msgstr ""
"Bilježi \"izlazne\" transfere (download-e sa servera) od strane pravih korisnika "
"(korisnici sa stvarnim kontom i bez ograničenja u pristupu)"

#: Logging.cpp:79
msgid "Anony&mous"
msgstr "Anoni&man"

#: Logging.cpp:81
msgid ""
"Keep a security log (failed login attempts etc.) for anonymous users "
"(username <i>anonymous</i> or <i>ftp</i>)"
msgstr ""
"Sačuvaj sigurnosne zabilješke (neuspjele prijave itd) za anonimne "
"korisnike (ime korisnika <i>anonymous</i> ili <i>ftp</i>)"

#: Logging.cpp:82
msgid "Gues&t"
msgstr "Gos&t"

#: Logging.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Keep a security log (failed login attempts etc.) for guest users (real users "
"with restricted access)"
msgstr ""
"Sačuvaj sigurnosne zabilješke (neuspjele prijave itd) za korisnike "
"\"goste\" (korisnici sa stvarnim kontom, ali sa ograničenim pristupom)"

#: Logging.cpp:85
msgid "Rea&l"
msgstr "Stvar&ni"

#: Logging.cpp:87
msgid ""
"Keep a security log (failed login attempts etc.) for guest users (real users "
"with unrestricted access)"
msgstr ""
"Sačuvaj sigurnosne zabilješke (neuspjele prijave itd) za \"stvarne\" korisnike "
"(korisnici sa stvarnim kontom i bez ograničenja u pristupu)"

#: Logging.cpp:88
msgid "Redirect lo&g to syslog"
msgstr "Preusmjeri zabilješke u syslo&g"

#: Logging.cpp:91
msgid "Log to syslog instead of logfiles"
msgstr "Bilježenje u syslog umjesto datoteka sa zabilješkama"

#: Logging.cpp:93
msgid "E&mail ftpadmin on uploads:"
msgstr "&e-mail za administratora pri upload-u:"

#: Logging.cpp:94
msgid "Automatically notify the administrator of uploads from anonymous users"
msgstr "Automatski obavijesti administratora o upload-ima od strane anonimusa :)"

#: Logging.cpp:98
msgid "&Send mail as"
msgstr "Pošalji &mail kao"

#: Logging.cpp:100
msgid ""
"The address entered here will appear in the <i>From:</i> header of upload "
"notification email messages sent by wu-ftpd."
msgstr ""
"Adresa koju ovdje unesete će biti u <i>Od:</i> zaglavlju obavještenja o "
"upload-u poslanom preko e-maila od strane wu-ftpd-a."

#: Logging.cpp:101
msgid "Mail ser&ver"
msgstr "Mail ser&ver"

#: Logging.cpp:103
msgid ""
"The mail server entered here will be used to transmit upload notification "
"email messages sent by wu-ftpd. If left blank, localhost will be used."
msgstr ""
"Mail server kojeg ovdje navedete će biti korišten za slanje e-maila sa "
"obavještenjem o upload-u. Ako ništa ne navedete, localhost će "
"biti korišten."

#: Logging.cpp:104
msgid "&Send mail to:"
msgstr "Po&šalji mail za:"

#: Logging.cpp:105 Logging.cpp:107
msgid ""
"This list box shows the recipient(s) of upload notification emails. Use the "
"<b>Add</b> and <b>Remove</b> buttons below to modify the recipients."
msgstr ""
"Ova lista prikazuje primaoca(e) obavještenja o upload-ima. Koristite "
"dugmad <b>Dodaj</b> i <b>Ukloni</b> da bi ste promijenili primaoce."

#: Logging.cpp:112 Ratios.cpp:91 Security.cpp:19 Uploads.cpp:25 Virtual.cpp:17
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "Dod&aj"

#: Logging.cpp:114
msgid "Add a new recipient for upload notification emails"
msgstr "Dodaj novog primaoca obavještenja o upload-ima"

#: Logging.cpp:118
msgid "Remove the currently selected recipient for upload notification emails"
msgstr "Ukloni trenutno izabranog primaoca obavještenja o upload-ima"

#: Messages.cpp:11
msgid "&Banner"
msgstr "&Banner"

#: Messages.cpp:14
msgid ""
"The file selected here will be displayed to\n"
"ftp users before login.\n"
"May break compatibility with truly ancient clients."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje izabrana datoteka će biti prikazana\n"
"korisnicima ftp-a prije prijave.\n"
"Ovo možda nije kompatibilno sa pravo starim\n"
"klijentima."

#: Messages.cpp:15
msgid "&Hostname (blank=default)"
msgstr "Ime &hosta (prazno=default)"

#: Messages.cpp:18
msgid ""
"The hostname given here will be shown at login and for\n"
"the %L cookie in message files.\n"
"If this is blank, the canonical hostname of your system will be used."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje navedeno ime hosta će biti prikazano kod prijave\n"
"i korišteno za %L cookie u datotekama s porukom.\n"
"Oko ovo ostavite prazno, sistemsko ime hosta će biti korišteno."

#: Messages.cpp:19
#, c-format
msgid "Email of &admin (for %E):"
msgstr "Email &administratora (za %E):"

#: Messages.cpp:21
#, c-format
msgid "Email address returned with the %E cookie in message files."
msgstr ""
"Email adresa dobijena pomoću %E cookie-ja u datotekama s "
"porukom."

#: Messages.cpp:23
msgid "Show &messages every time"
msgstr "Pokaži po&ruke svaki put"

#: Messages.cpp:24
msgid "If this is not checked, message files at CWD will be displayed only once."
msgstr ""
"Ako ovo nije označeno, poruka pri komandi CWD će biti prikazana samo "
"jednom."

#: Messages.cpp:26
msgid "Show &readmes every time"
msgstr "Pokaži proči&taj_me (readme) svaki put"

#: Messages.cpp:29
msgid "If this is not checked, hints on README files will be displayed only once."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ovo neoznačeno, datoteka pročitaj_me (README) će biti prikazana "
"samo jednom."

#: Messages.cpp:30
msgid "Add M&essage"
msgstr "Dodaj P&oruku"

#: Messages.cpp:31
msgid "Remo&ve Message"
msgstr "Uk&loni poruku"

#: Messages.cpp:32
msgid "Add Rea&dme"
msgstr "Dodaj Rea&dme"

#: Messages.cpp:33
msgid "Rem&ove Readme"
msgstr "Ukloni Read&me"

#: Messages.cpp:34
msgid "&Messages:"
msgstr "&Poruke:"

#: Messages.cpp:36
msgid "&Readmes:"
msgstr "&Readme datoteke:"

#: Messages.cpp:42 Messages.cpp:44 Messages.cpp:45 Messages.cpp:46
msgid ""
"Messages are files that are automatically displayed to the user after "
"logging in or after entering a directory. Use the <b>Add Message</b> and "
"<b>Remove Message</b> buttons to modify the messages."
msgstr ""
"Poruke su datoteke koje su automatski prikazane korisnicima poslije prijave, "
"ili prilikom ulaska u direktorij. Koristite dugmad <b>Dodaj poruku</b> i "
"<b>Ukloni poruku</b> za izmjenu poruka."

#: Messages.cpp:53 Messages.cpp:54 Messages.cpp:55 Messages.cpp:56
msgid ""
"When you've defined README files, users changing to a directory containing "
"files matching the glob listed here will be pointed to these files with a "
"<i>Please read the file README, last modified x days ago</i> message.<br>Use "
"the <b>Add Readme</b> and <b>Remove Readme</b> buttons to modify the list of "
"README files."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste odredili README datoteke, korisnici koji uđu u direktorij što sadrži "
"datoteke koje se poklapaju sa ovdje prikazanim glob-om će dobiti uputu "
"<i>Molimo vas da pročitate README, promijenjen prije x dana</i>. <br>Koristite "
"dugmad <b>Dodaj Readme</b> i <b>Ukloni Readme</b> da bi ste izmjenili listu "
"README datoteka."

