#: Security.cpp:18 Security.cpp:24 Security.cpp:30 Security.cpp:31
msgid ""
"Noretrieves are files and directories that can't be retrieved (downloaded) "
"by remote users. Use the <b>Add</b> and <b>Remove</b> buttons below to "
"control noretrieves."
msgstr ""
"Nema_skidanja su datoteke i direktoriji koji se ne mogu skidati (download) "
"od strane korisnika. Koristite dugmad <b>Dodaj</b> i <b>Ukloni</b> dole "
"ispod za kontrolu \"nema_skidanja\"."

#: Security.cpp:32
msgid "Number of allo&wed failed logins:"
msgstr "Broj doz&voljenih neuspjelih prijava:"

#: Security.cpp:34 Security.cpp:37
msgid ""
"A user may attempt to login with a wrong password this many times before the "
"connection is closed."
msgstr ""
"Ovoliko puta neki korisnik može pokušati da se prijavi s pogrešnom šifrom "
"prije nego što se veza prekine."

#: Security.cpp:46
msgid "Permit SITE &GROUP"
msgstr "Dozvoli SITE &GROUP"

#: Security.cpp:47
msgid ""
"Permit users to change their group membership using the ftp SITE GROUP "
"command"
msgstr ""
"Dozvoljava korisnicima da promjene svoju grupnu pripadnost uz pomoć ftp "
"komande SITE GROUP"

#: Security.cpp:53
